  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `site/content/guide/reference/troubleshooting.md`: the heading for the\n  incomplete-model refusal now quotes the message as the app prints it.\n  The stem the guard reads is the fixed text `imported incomplete - ` and\n  `so it has walls missing and no gouge check against it can be trusted; `.\n- `docs/decisions/2051-troubleshooting-stem.md`: the decision entry.\n\nThe guard was not changed. The message is a format string in\n`crates/app/src/mesh_open.rs`, so its old literal is gone from the sources.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `troubleshooting_messages_still_exist_in_the_sources` (camcraft-app,\n  binary `docs_troubleshooting`): `ok`, run through\n  `cargo xtask gate test ... --crate camcraft-app`.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Other camcraft-app suites and clippy. The doc change touches no code.\n- The next post-merge run on main.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2051\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
